WEBVTT

00:01.094 --> 00:03.991
<i>[spooky music]</i>
<i>[幽灵音乐]</i>

00:04.059 --> 00:10.094
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:10.163 --> 00:13.232
[urchins chattering]
[顽童叽叽喳喳]

00:17.991 --> 00:20.922
<i>[ominous music]</i>
<i>[不祥的音乐]</i>

00:20.991 --> 00:23.473
[urchins screaming]
[顽童尖叫]

00:29.542 --> 00:31.508
Biting my begonias, eh?
咬我的海棠吧？

00:31.577 --> 00:34.335
Not on my watch!
[laughs]
不在我的监视之下！
[笑]

00:34.404 --> 00:35.853
Mailman!
邮递员！

00:35.922 --> 00:37.439
Wha...?
世界卫生大会...？

00:41.025 --> 00:43.956
[screams]
[尖叫声]

00:45.163 --> 00:47.922
Oh, a letter.
Uh, thank you!
哦，一封信。
呃，谢谢你！

00:50.335 --> 00:51.956
Nosferatu?
诺斯费拉图？

00:52.025 --> 00:52.956
[lighting cracks]
[灯光裂缝]

00:53.025 --> 00:54.197
Huh?
What?
啊？
什么？

00:54.266 --> 00:55.266
[sighs]
[叹气]

00:55.335 --> 00:57.991
I got his mail by mistake again!
我又错收到他的邮件了！

00:58.059 --> 00:59.922
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

00:59.991 --> 01:02.473
I'll just file that in here.
我就把它归档在这里。

01:02.542 --> 01:03.473
[muffled speech]
[低声说话]

01:03.542 --> 01:06.680
[chuckles]
Huh?
[笑声]
啊？

01:06.749 --> 01:09.887
- [muffled speech]
- SpongeBob?
- [低声说话]
- 海绵宝宝？

01:09.956 --> 01:13.404
[muffled speech]
[低声说话]

01:13.473 --> 01:16.784
What are you doing
in my garbage?
你在做什么
在我的垃圾里？

01:19.749 --> 01:22.301
♪ Spring cleaning ♪
♪ 春季大扫除 ♪

01:22.370 --> 01:24.991
But, Squidward, for shame.
但是，章鱼哥，真是羞耻。

01:25.059 --> 01:28.646
You can't just throw out
the mail of Nosferatu.
你不能直接扔掉
诺斯费拉图的邮件。

01:28.715 --> 01:30.473
[lightning crashes]
- Huh?
[闪电坠毁]
- 啊？

01:30.542 --> 01:33.232
You have to deliver it yourself.
您必须亲自交付。

01:33.301 --> 01:34.370
[gasps]
[喘气]

01:34.439 --> 01:36.335
Otherwise, it'd be
a federal crime!
不然就变成了
联邦犯罪！

01:36.404 --> 01:39.094
And I'll be an accessory!
而我将成为一个附属品！

01:39.163 --> 01:42.025
[hyperventilating]
[换气过度]

01:44.025 --> 01:46.818
All right, already!
I'll take it to him.
好吧，已经！
我会把它带给他。

01:46.887 --> 01:48.370
Hurray!
欢呼！

01:48.439 --> 01:50.611
But you are carrying the mail.
但你正在携带邮件。

01:50.680 --> 01:52.818
Ha!
One little letter?
哈!
一封小信？

01:52.887 --> 01:54.818
- No problemo.
<i>- Hold on.</i>
- 没问题。
<i>- 等等。</i>

01:54.887 --> 01:56.577
There's more.
还有更多。

01:56.646 --> 02:00.577
- Ooh!
- Here's the rest of it.
- 哦！
- Here's the rest of it.

02:00.646 --> 02:02.508
I have been getting
that creepy guy's mail
我一直在得到
那个令人毛骨悚然的家伙的邮件

02:02.577 --> 02:04.577
by mistake for years!
错误多年！

02:04.646 --> 02:07.542
[gasps]
Squidward, look!
[喘气]
章鱼哥，看！

02:07.611 --> 02:11.059
"Bleeder's Digest."
"Bat Fancy."
《布莱德文摘》。
“蝙蝠幻想。”

02:11.128 --> 02:12.818
"Blood of the Month Club."
“本月俱乐部之血。”

02:12.887 --> 02:14.439
[blood squelches]
[血腥味]

02:14.508 --> 02:15.853
Eh.
呃。

02:15.922 --> 02:19.025
Squidward, do you
know what this means?
章鱼哥，你呢
知道这意味着什么吗？

02:19.094 --> 02:20.508
No.
不。

02:20.577 --> 02:24.059
It means somebody
is going to be very happy
这意味着某人
会很开心

02:24.128 --> 02:30.232
to get all their mail,
somebody named Nosferatu.
获取他们所有的邮件，
一个叫诺斯费拉图的人。

02:30.301 --> 02:31.577
[lightning crashes]
- Ah!
[闪电坠毁]
- 啊！

02:31.646 --> 02:32.887
Huh?
What?
啊？
什么？

02:32.956 --> 02:34.956
What was that?
Stop looking at me.
那是什么？
别再看着我了。

02:35.025 --> 02:36.887
[wolf howls]
[狼嚎]

02:36.956 --> 02:39.991
[whistling melody]
[口哨旋律]

02:45.715 --> 02:48.232
Well, this is the address.
嗯，这就是地址。

02:48.301 --> 02:51.059
[grunts]
- Ooh!
[咕哝]
- 哦！

02:51.128 --> 02:54.853
That castle is so high!
那个城堡好高啊！

03:00.059 --> 03:03.094
[whistling melody]
[口哨旋律]

03:03.163 --> 03:05.680
Please, I beg you,
拜托，我求求你，

03:05.749 --> 03:11.197
do not go to the castle!
The master is a vampire!
不要去城堡！
主人是吸血鬼！

03:11.266 --> 03:14.232
He means to suck your blood!
他的意思是要吸你的血！

03:14.301 --> 03:16.025
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

03:16.094 --> 03:21.715
- What are you talking about?
- Nosferatu!
- 你在说什么？
- 诺斯费拉图！

03:21.784 --> 03:22.818
[lightning crashes]
[闪电坠毁]

03:22.887 --> 03:25.611
- Mm-hmm.
- [laughs]
- 嗯嗯。
- [笑]

03:25.680 --> 03:27.680
Right.
I'm sorry.
正确的。
对不起。

03:27.749 --> 03:29.646
I don't have any spare change.
我没有零钱。

03:29.715 --> 03:32.922
Don't go to the castle!
Don't go to the castle!
别去城堡！
别去城堡！

03:32.991 --> 03:35.542
Don't go...
[skeletal seahorse neighs]
别走...
[骷髅海马嘶鸣]

03:35.611 --> 03:38.749
[snarls]
[咆哮]

03:42.715 --> 03:44.956
- Ow!
- Ah!
- 噢！
- 啊！

03:45.025 --> 03:50.059
Well, a coach to the castle.
How elegant.
嗯，有去城堡的长途汽车。
多么优雅啊。

03:50.128 --> 03:53.646
Step lively, SpongeBob.
- [grunting]
行动起来吧，海绵宝宝。
- [咕哝]

03:57.370 --> 04:01.542
[humming melody]
- [gasps]
[哼唱的旋律]
- [喘气]

04:01.611 --> 04:06.542
- The castle!
- Aw.
- 城堡！
- 噢。

04:06.611 --> 04:10.370
Looks like someone
could use a Krabby Patty.
看起来像某人
可以用蟹肉饼。

04:10.439 --> 04:13.370
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

04:13.439 --> 04:20.370
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:20.439 --> 04:23.473
[chuckles]
[笑声]

04:23.542 --> 04:26.439
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

04:26.508 --> 04:30.232
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:30.301 --> 04:32.094
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

04:32.163 --> 04:38.577
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:38.646 --> 04:40.094
Whoo!
Whoo!
呼！
呼！

04:40.163 --> 04:42.404
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:42.473 --> 04:44.439
- Whoa!
- Oh, whoa!
- 哇！
- 哦，哇！

04:44.508 --> 04:46.025
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:49.059 --> 04:51.818
We're taking
the bus on the way home!
我们正在采取
回家路上的公交车！

04:54.301 --> 04:56.853
- [grunts]
- Huh?
- [咕哝]
- 啊？

04:56.922 --> 04:58.508
Hmm.
唔。

04:58.577 --> 05:01.439
<i>[eerie organ music]</i>
<i>[怪异的管风琴音乐]</i>

05:01.508 --> 05:05.163
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:05.232 --> 05:07.542
[wolf howls]
[狼嚎]

05:07.611 --> 05:08.611
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:08.646 --> 05:09.784
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

05:12.232 --> 05:14.094
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

05:15.335 --> 05:17.749
[knocks]
[敲门声]

05:17.818 --> 05:21.059
Hello, Nosferatu?
你好，诺斯费拉图？

05:21.128 --> 05:23.611
[lightning crashes]
Hmm.
[闪电坠毁]
嗯。

05:23.680 --> 05:26.956
Well, looks like nobody's home.
嗯，看来没人在家。

05:27.025 --> 05:28.335
Of course.
当然。

05:29.991 --> 05:32.128
Hello?
你好？

05:35.335 --> 05:37.991
We're just here
to drop off your mail.
我们就在这里
投递您的邮件。

05:38.059 --> 05:39.646
Whoa!
哇！

05:39.715 --> 05:41.094
[lightning crashes]
- [screams]
[闪电坠毁]
- [尖叫]

05:41.163 --> 05:43.646
What's happening?
发生什么事了？

05:43.715 --> 05:45.956
[snickering]
[窃笑]

05:46.025 --> 05:49.128
Aw!
It's just Nosferatu!
噢！
这只是诺斯费拉图！

05:49.197 --> 05:52.680
[lightning crashes]
- Whew!
[闪电坠毁]
- 哇！

05:52.749 --> 05:55.646
<i>[eerie music]</i>
<i>[怪异音乐]</i>

05:55.715 --> 05:56.818
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:56.887 --> 06:00.680
- [hisses]
- [screams]
- [嘶嘶声]
- [尖叫]

06:00.749 --> 06:03.646
<i>[plucky music]</i>
<i>[勇敢的音乐]</i>

06:03.715 --> 06:06.508
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:06.577 --> 06:08.818
The master bids you welcome,
主人恭候您的光临，

06:08.887 --> 06:13.266
and he thanks you
for dropping off his mail.
他谢谢你
投递他的邮件。

06:13.335 --> 06:14.956
Oh.
哦。

06:17.611 --> 06:19.232
Ooh.
哦。

06:23.611 --> 06:25.715
[belches]
[打嗝]

06:25.784 --> 06:29.715
[giggles]
- [laughs]
[咯咯笑]
- [笑]

06:29.784 --> 06:31.922
[laughs]
[笑]

06:31.991 --> 06:36.680
- [laughs]
- [laughs]
- [笑]
- [笑]

06:36.749 --> 06:40.473
[laughter]
[笑声]

06:40.542 --> 06:42.646
Hmm?
[groans]
唔？
[呻吟]

06:42.715 --> 06:45.680
[laughter]
[笑声]

06:45.749 --> 06:49.853
Knock it off!
- I am sorry, Master.
关掉它！
- 对不起，师父。

06:49.922 --> 06:52.059
It won't happen again.
这样的事不会再发生了。

06:56.128 --> 06:59.473
Ew.
We'll let ourselves out.
呃。
我们会放飞自我。

06:59.542 --> 07:01.680
Aw, I don't want to leave.
唉，我不想离开。

07:01.749 --> 07:02.956
Boo!
嘘！

07:03.025 --> 07:05.301
[lightning crashes]
- Ah!
[闪电坠毁]
- 啊！

07:05.370 --> 07:10.232
Oh, you can't leave
due to inclement weather.
哦，你不能离开
由于恶劣天气。

07:10.301 --> 07:13.266
We can't leave yet.
Yay!
我们还不能离开。
耶！

07:13.335 --> 07:16.059
<i>[eerie music]</i>
<i>[怪异音乐]</i>

07:16.128 --> 07:17.508
Gulp.
咕噜咕噜。

07:17.577 --> 07:20.646
The Master has invited you
to stay for the night,
大师邀请你了
留下来过夜，

07:20.715 --> 07:24.715
but first, he would like
to have you both for dinner.
但首先他想
请你们俩共进晚餐。

07:24.784 --> 07:26.163
[laughs]
[笑]

07:26.232 --> 07:28.853
[laughs]
[笑]

07:30.404 --> 07:33.128
Well, uh,
under the circumstances,
嗯，呃，
在这种情况下，

07:33.197 --> 07:36.473
I wouldn't mind some
fine Transylvanian cuisine
我不介意一些
精致的特兰西瓦尼亚美食

07:36.542 --> 07:39.128
for a change.
- Change?
为了改变。
- 改变？

07:39.197 --> 07:41.853
I can make change.
[laughs]
我可以做出改变。
[笑]

07:41.922 --> 07:43.818
Get away from me.
离我远点。

07:45.887 --> 07:48.404
[snorting and chuckling]
Come, come.
[哼哼和咯咯笑]
来吧，来吧。

07:48.473 --> 07:51.370
- Oh, oh.
- [laughs]
- 哦，哦。
- [笑]

07:51.439 --> 07:58.301
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:01.715 --> 08:04.680
[laughs]
[笑]

08:04.749 --> 08:08.542
<i>[gentle violin music]</i>
<i>[轻柔的小提琴音乐]</i>

08:08.611 --> 08:10.301
Wow!
What a spread.
哇！
多么广泛啊。

08:10.370 --> 08:12.784
I don't know what to try first.
我不知道先尝试什么。

08:12.853 --> 08:17.335
Oh, I can help you decide.
[laughs]
哦，我可以帮你决定。
[笑]

08:17.404 --> 08:21.059
We have roasted werewolf teeth,
我们有烤狼人的牙齿，

08:21.128 --> 08:25.301
pickled demon beards,
fried mummy fingers,
腌制的恶魔胡须，
炸妈妈手指，

08:25.370 --> 08:28.163
and brains tartare.
- [retches]
和鞑靼的大脑。
- [干呕]

08:28.232 --> 08:32.232
Ooh, don't mind if I do... oh.
[laughs]
哦，别介意我这样做……哦。
[笑]

08:32.301 --> 08:36.956
Or maybe you would like
something sinfully succulent.
或者也许你会想要
罪恶多汁的东西。

08:37.025 --> 08:40.059
Ooh, a Carpathian cheese ball.
哦，喀尔巴阡奶酪球。

08:40.128 --> 08:41.922
Uh, eh.
- Whoopsie!
呃，呃。
- 哎哟！

08:41.991 --> 08:45.991
That's my dinner.
Come to daddy!
这就是我的晚餐。
来爸爸身边吧！

08:46.059 --> 08:49.439
- Ooh.
- [groans]
- 哦。
- [呻吟]

08:49.508 --> 08:52.370
Oh, you've got to try
these mummy fingers, Squidward.
哦，你必须尝试一下
这些木乃伊手指，章鱼哥。

08:52.439 --> 08:54.370
So delicious.
真好吃。

08:54.439 --> 08:57.163
Nosferatu, you simply
must give me the recipe.
诺斯费拉图，你只是
必须给我食谱。

08:57.232 --> 08:58.439
Hm.
嗯。

08:58.508 --> 09:00.059
<i>[woman screams]</i>
<i>[女人尖叫]</i>

09:00.128 --> 09:03.025
Well, maybe if I put
some ketchup on it.
好吧，也许如果我把
上面放一些番茄酱。

09:03.094 --> 09:05.197
[munching]
Ketchup?
[咀嚼]
番茄酱？

09:05.266 --> 09:07.025
Good thing I came prepared.
还好我有备而来。

09:08.646 --> 09:09.956
Ketching up!
番茄酱！

09:10.025 --> 09:13.439
<i>[energetic music]</i>
<i>[充满活力的音乐]</i>

09:13.508 --> 09:15.853
Hmm.
Ah.
唔。
啊。

09:15.922 --> 09:18.577
[laughs]
Whoa!
[笑]
哇！

09:18.646 --> 09:19.818
[sighs]
[叹气]

09:19.887 --> 09:22.059
[growls]
[咆哮]

09:23.853 --> 09:26.335
[slurps]
[啜饮]

09:26.404 --> 09:29.611
[gags]
- Nosferatu, ketchup?
[笑点]
- 诺斯费拉图，番茄酱？

09:29.680 --> 09:32.197
Whoa!
- Mm-hm.
哇！
- 嗯嗯。

09:32.266 --> 09:36.577
[sighs]
- [laughs]
[叹气]
- [笑]

09:36.646 --> 09:38.232
[hisses]
[嘶嘶声]

09:38.301 --> 09:41.266
The Master says, "Sleep tight
师父说：“睡个好觉吧

09:41.335 --> 09:44.128
and don't let
the vampire bats bite."
并且不要让
吸血蝙蝠会咬人。”

09:44.197 --> 09:46.197
[laughs]
[笑]

09:46.266 --> 09:47.370
[laughs]
[笑]

09:47.439 --> 09:50.370
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:51.922 --> 09:53.749
[hisses]
[嘶嘶声]

09:53.818 --> 09:56.335
The Master bids you good night.
大师向您道晚安。

09:56.404 --> 09:58.404
[laughs softly]
[轻笑]

09:58.473 --> 10:01.128
Good night, Nosferatu!
晚安，诺斯费拉图！

10:01.197 --> 10:03.956
<i>[eerie organ music]</i>
<i>[怪异的管风琴音乐]</i>

10:04.025 --> 10:06.715
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:06.784 --> 10:08.991
This place gives me the creeps.
这个地方让我毛骨悚然。

10:09.059 --> 10:11.542
But so what?
It's only one night.
但那又怎样呢？
这只是一晚。

10:11.611 --> 10:12.922
Right, SpongeB...
对了，海绵宝宝……

10:12.991 --> 10:16.163
[snoring]
[打鼾]

10:18.059 --> 10:19.680
- Huh?
- Whoops!
- 啊？
- 哎呀！

10:19.749 --> 10:21.956
Forgot to brush my teeth.
忘记刷牙了。

10:22.025 --> 10:24.922
<i>[tense music]</i>
<i>[紧张的音乐]</i>

10:24.991 --> 10:26.853
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:26.922 --> 10:29.646
[snoring]
Whoops!
[打鼾]
哎呀！

10:29.715 --> 10:31.370
Forgot to floss.
- Huh?
忘记用牙线。
- 啊？

10:34.715 --> 10:36.887
[snoring]
Ooh!
[打鼾]
哦！

10:36.956 --> 10:38.991
Forgot to wash my head.
- Huh?
忘记洗头了。
- 啊？

10:42.887 --> 10:44.473
Whoops!
Forgot to polish my eyes.
哎呀！
忘记擦亮眼睛了。

10:44.542 --> 10:47.266
Huh?
啊？

10:47.335 --> 10:49.991
Will you go
night night time already?
你会去吗
已经晚上了吗？

10:50.059 --> 10:52.335
Nosferatu?
诺斯费拉图？

10:52.404 --> 10:54.680
Why are you sticking out
of the wall like that?
你为什么坚持
是这样的墙吗？

10:54.749 --> 10:56.508
[hisses]
[嘶嘶声]

10:56.577 --> 10:58.335
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:59.611 --> 11:02.853
I can't believe Nosferatu
tried to bite me!
我不敢相信诺斯费拉图
试图咬我！

11:02.922 --> 11:06.094
He's a real life v-v-vampire!
他是现实生活中的吸血鬼！

11:06.163 --> 11:10.163
He's gonna suck our blood!
[sobs]
他会吸干我们的血！
[抽泣]

11:10.232 --> 11:13.059
There's got to be
a way out of this castle!
一定有
离开这座城堡的出路！

11:13.128 --> 11:16.646
I can show you a way out!
我可以给你指一条出路！

11:16.715 --> 11:19.646
[laughs]
[笑]

11:21.508 --> 11:24.232
Slappy sleepy.
昏昏欲睡。

11:25.749 --> 11:27.301
Let's try these doors!
让我们试试这些门吧！

11:27.370 --> 11:28.680
[snarls]
[咆哮]

11:28.749 --> 11:29.991
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

11:30.059 --> 11:31.439
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:31.508 --> 11:32.956
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

11:34.163 --> 11:36.542
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

11:36.611 --> 11:39.887
[both hyperventilating]
[双方都过度换气]

11:39.956 --> 11:41.887
[together]
Gorilla monster!
[一起]
大猩猩怪物！

11:41.956 --> 11:43.818
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

11:43.887 --> 11:45.991
Quick, down the laundry chute!
快，从洗衣槽下去！

11:49.715 --> 11:50.853
[screams]
[尖叫声]

11:50.922 --> 11:52.059
[loud thud]
[巨响]

11:52.128 --> 11:53.991
- Whoa!
- [screaming]
- 哇！
- [尖叫]

11:56.059 --> 11:57.542
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

11:57.611 --> 12:02.025
It's a vampire's coffin!
[whimpers]
这是吸血鬼的棺材！
[呜咽]

12:02.094 --> 12:04.991
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

12:05.059 --> 12:10.784
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

12:10.853 --> 12:12.784
Nosferatu two-step!
诺斯费拉图两步走！

12:12.853 --> 12:16.059
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

12:16.128 --> 12:18.404
Yay!
Ow.
耶！
噢。

12:18.473 --> 12:20.301
Snap out of it, SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝，振作起来！

12:20.370 --> 12:22.680
What if he bites our necks...
[gasps]
如果他咬住我们的脖子怎么办？
[喘气]

12:22.749 --> 12:25.094
Or my nose?
- Oh!
还是我的鼻子？
- 哦！

12:25.163 --> 12:26.611
I know what to do.
我知道该怎么做。

12:26.680 --> 12:29.887
In those vampire movies,
they always make wooden stakes.
那些吸血鬼电影里，
他们总是做木桩。

12:29.956 --> 12:31.853
[gasps]
That's a great idea!
[喘气]
这是个好主意！

12:31.922 --> 12:33.025
Here!
这里！

12:34.542 --> 12:35.818
<i>[cow moos]</i>
<i>[牛哞哞]</i>

12:35.887 --> 12:37.577
Will these even work
without steak sauce?
这些还能用吗
没有牛排酱？

12:40.818 --> 12:43.301
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

12:43.370 --> 12:47.473
You shouldn't disturb
the master's laundry tomb.
你不应该打扰
主人的洗衣墓。

12:47.542 --> 12:51.577
He would be very cranky
if he found you here,
他会很暴躁
如果他在这里找到你

12:51.646 --> 12:56.025
and you never know
where he might be.
你永远不知道
他可能在哪里。

12:56.094 --> 12:57.956
He's right behind us, isn't he?
他就在我们后面，不是吗？

12:58.025 --> 12:59.508
Hmm?
Nope.
唔？
没有。

12:59.577 --> 13:02.473
Nobody there.
We're fine.
那里没有人。
我们很好。

13:02.542 --> 13:04.784
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

13:04.853 --> 13:06.853
Please don't eat us!
请不要吃我们！

13:06.922 --> 13:09.887
Oh, the master is not hungry.
哦，主人不饿。

13:09.956 --> 13:12.128
He just had a big lunch.
他刚刚吃了一顿丰盛的午餐。

13:12.197 --> 13:15.646
He wanted to return your mail.
他想退回你的邮件。

13:15.715 --> 13:18.887
Oh.
Well, how thoughtful of you.
哦。
嗯，你想得真周到。

13:18.956 --> 13:20.991
Uh, thanks.
- Ooh!
呃，谢谢。
- 哦！

13:21.059 --> 13:22.197
Open it, Squidward!
打开它，章鱼哥！

13:22.266 --> 13:23.956
What'd you get?
- Let's see.
你得到了什么？
- 让我们来看看。

13:24.025 --> 13:25.163
Oh, yes!
哦是的！

13:25.232 --> 13:27.577
It's my Garlic
of the Month Club!
这是我的大蒜
月俱乐部！

13:27.646 --> 13:29.991
Wait.
Uh-oh.
等待。
呃哦。

13:30.059 --> 13:33.163
[gagging]
[作呕]

13:34.059 --> 13:35.508
[chuckles]
[笑声]

13:35.577 --> 13:38.473
The master
is just joshing with you.
大师
只是跟你开玩笑。

13:38.542 --> 13:40.404
He loves garlic.
他喜欢大蒜。

13:40.473 --> 13:43.128
[laughter]
- Um.
[笑声]
- 嗯。

13:43.197 --> 13:45.197
Oh!
[laughter]
哦！
[笑声]

13:45.266 --> 13:48.025
- Huh?
- Mm-mm-mm.
- 啊？
- 毫米-毫米-毫米。

13:48.094 --> 13:50.991
Well, if you're not flicking
the lights on and off,
好吧，如果你不轻弹的话
灯的打开和关闭，

13:51.059 --> 13:52.853
then who is?
那么是谁呢？

13:52.922 --> 13:55.611
<i>[eerie organ music]</i>
<i>[怪异的管风琴音乐]</i>

13:55.680 --> 13:58.163
[together]
Phantom of the Opera!
[一起]
歌剧魅影！

13:58.232 --> 13:59.646
[laughs]
[笑]

13:59.715 --> 14:02.646
[laughter]
[笑声]

[笑声]